{"title":"Rédige un document professionnel","ts":"2026-10-11T13:20:33.544Z","msgs":[{"id":"ei1s8spde2","role":"user","text":"Rédige un document professionnel","apiText":"Rédige un document professionnel","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:20:33.290Z","hidden":false},{"id":"fqds2ms1je","role":"user","text":"codé une application que j'ouvre \nje configure mon token \ntout les dépôts affiche \net je clique sur un dépôt tout les fichiers affiche \nje peux chercher des fichiers \net je renomme le fichier","apiText":"codé une application que j'ouvre \nje configure mon token \ntout les dépôts affiche \net je clique sur un dépôt tout les fichiers affiche \nje peux chercher des fichiers \net je renomme le fichier","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:22:37.898Z","hidden":false},{"id":"l642t4s1jm","role":"bot","thinking":false,"text":"Voici l'application web complète et professionnelle pour gérer vos dépôts GitHub directement depuis une interface interactive. Elle inclut la configuration du token personnel, la liste des dépôts, l'explorateur de fichiers par dépôt, la recherche instantanée de fichiers et la fonctionnalité de renommage en utilisant directement l'API REST de GitHub.\n\n\n\nPour utiliser cette application :\n1. Enregistrez le code ci-dessus dans un fichier nommé `index.html`.\n2. Ouvrez ce fichier directement dans n'importe quel navigateur web moderne.\n3. Entrez votre *Personal Access Token* GitHub (avec les permissions `repo`) dans le champ supérieur et cliquez sur **Enregistrer**.\n4. Tous vos dépôts s'affichent automatiquement dans la barre latérale. Cliquez sur l'un d'eux pour lister ses fichiers, utilisez la barre de recherche pour filtrer instantanément, et cliquez sur **Renommer** sur n'importe quel fichier pour modifier son nom en toute simplicité.","ts":"2026-10-11T13:22:37.906Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Je crée une application Web moderne et complète pour gérer ses dépôts GitHub, configurer son token, lister les fichiers, rechercher dedans e…","status":"done","details":"Je crée une application Web moderne et complète pour gérer ses dépôts GitHub, configurer son token, lister les fichiers, rechercher dedans et renommer un fichier."}],"codeBlocks":[{"lang":"html","filename":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Gestionnaire Pro de Dépôts GitHub</title>\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-main: #0f172a;\n            --bg-card: #1e293b;\n            --bg-hover: #334155;\n            --text-main: #f8fafc;\n            --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n            --primary: #6366f1;\n            --primary-hover: #4f46e5;\n            --border: #334155;\n            --success: #22c55e;\n            --danger: #ef4444;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .token-container {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        input, button {\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            outline: none;\n            transition: border-color 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        input:focus {\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        button {\n            background-color: var(--primary);\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        button:hover {\n            background-color: var(--primary-hover);\n        }\n\n        button.secondary {\n            background-color: transparent;\n            border-color: var(--border);\n        }\n\n        button.secondary:hover {\n            background-color: var(--bg-hover);\n        }\n\n        main {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;\n            height: calc(100vh - 65px);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        aside {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar-header {\n            padding: 1rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n\n        .repo-list {\n            flex: 1;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n            transition: background-color 0.2s;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item:hover {\n            background-color: var(--bg-hover);\n        }\n\n        .repo-item.active {\n            background-color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .repo-name {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-desc {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            text-overflow: ellipsis;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item.active .repo-desc {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        section.content {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n        }\n\n        .content-header {\n            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n        }\n\n        .file-explorer {\n            flex: 1;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .search-box {\n            width: 100%;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n        }\n\n        th, td {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n\n        th {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n        }\n\n        tr:hover td {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n        }\n\n        .file-row {\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;\n            border-radius: 0.25rem;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .badge-file { background-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); color: #818cf8; }\n        .badge-dir { background-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.2); color: #facc15; }\n\n        .actions {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .modal {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .modal.open {\n            display: flex;\n        }\n\n        .modal-content {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 0.5rem;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 450px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .modal-footer {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .alert {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .alert.error { background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); border: 1px solid var(--danger); color: #fca5a5; }\n        .alert.success { background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); border: 1px solid var(--success); color: #86efac; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <header>\n        <h1><span>📂</span> Gestionnaire GitHub Pro</h1>\n        <div class=\"token-container\">\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"tokenInput\" placeholder=\"Collez votre Personal Access Token\">\n            <button onclick=\"saveToken()\">Enregistrer</button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n        <aside>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-header\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"repoSearch\" placeholder=\"Filtrer les dépôts...\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"filterRepos()\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"repo-list\" id=\"repoList\">\n                <div style=\"padding: 1rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem;\">\n                    Configurez votre token pour afficher vos dépôts.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"content-header\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 id=\"currentRepoTitle\">Sélectionnez un dépôt</h2>\n                    <p id=\"currentPath\" style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);\"></p>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"breadcrumb\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"file-explorer\">\n                <div id=\"alertBox\" class=\"alert\"></div>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"fileSearch\" class=\"search-box\" placeholder=\"Rechercher un fichier par nom...\" oninput=\"filterFiles()\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                \n                <div id=\"fileContainer\">\n                    <div style=\"text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 3rem;\">\n                        Choisissez un dépôt dans la liste de gauche pour explorer son contenu.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"modal\" id=\"renameModal\">\n        <div class=\"modal-content\">\n            <h3>Renommer le fichier</h3>\n            <p id=\"renameFileInfo\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted);\"></p>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"newFileNameInput\" placeholder=\"Nouveau nom du fichier\">\n            <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n                <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"closeRenameModal()\">Annuler</button>\n                <button onclick=\"confirmRename()\">Renommer</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let token = localStorage.getItem('github_token') || '';\n        let allRepos = [];\n        let currentRepo = null;\n        let currentFiles = [];\n        let fileToRename = null;\n        let currentPathStack = [];\n\n        if (token) {\n            document.getElementById('tokenInput').value = token;\n            fetchRepositories();\n        }\n\n        function saveToken() {\n            const val = document.getElementById('tokenInput').value.trim();\n            if (!val) {\n                showAlert('Veuillez entrer un token valide.', 'error');\n                return;\n            }\n            token = val;\n            localStorage.setItem('github_token', token);\n            showAlert('Token enregistré avec succès !', 'success');\n            fetchRepositories();\n        }\n\n        async function githubApi(endpoint) {\n            const response = await fetch(`https://api.github.com${endpoint}`, {\n                headers: {\n                    'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                    'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json'\n                }\n            });\n            if (!response.ok) {\n                const err = await response.json();\n                throw new Error(err.message || 'Erreur API GitHub');\n            }\n            return response.json();\n        }\n\n        async function fetchRepositories() {\n            try {\n                showAlert('Chargement des dépôts...', 'success');\n                allRepos = await githubApi('/user/repos?per_page=100&sort=updated');\n                renderRepos(allRepos);\n                hideAlert();\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du chargement des dépôts : ' + error.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderRepos(repos) {\n            const list = document.getElementById('repoList');\n            if (repos.length === 0) {\n                list.innerHTML = '<div style=\"padding: 1rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem;\">Aucun dépôt trouvé.</div>';\n                return;\n            }\n            list.innerHTML = repos.map(repo => `\n                <div class=\"repo-item ${currentRepo && currentRepo.full_name === repo.full_name ? 'active' : ''}\" onclick=\"selectRepo('${repo.full_name}')\">\n                    <div class=\"repo-name\">${repo.name}</div>\n                    <div class=\"repo-desc\">${repo.description || 'Pas de description'}</div>\n                </div>\n            `).join('');\n        }\n\n        function filterRepos() {\n            const query = document.getElementById('repoSearch').value.toLowerCase();\n            const filtered = allRepos.filter(r => r.name.toLowerCase().includes(query) || (r.description && r.description.toLowerCase().includes(query)));\n            renderRepos(filtered);\n        }\n\n        async function selectRepo(fullName) {\n            currentRepo = allRepos.find(r => r.full_name === fullName);\n            renderRepos(allRepos);\n            document.getElementById('currentRepoTitle').innerText = currentRepo.name;\n            currentPathStack = [];\n            await loadPathContents('');\n        }\n\n        async function loadPathContents(path) {\n            try {\n                showAlert('Chargement des fichiers...', 'success');\n                const contents = await githubApi(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${path}`);\n                currentFiles = Array.isArray(contents) ? contents : [contents];\n                \n                document.getElementById('currentPath').innerText = `/${path}`;\n                document.getElementById('fileSearch').style.display = 'block';\n                renderFiles(currentFiles);\n                hideAlert();\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du chargement du contenu : ' + error.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderFiles(files) {\n            const container = document.getElementById('fileContainer');\n            if (files.length === 0) {\n                container.innerHTML = '<div style=\"text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2rem;\">Ce dossier est vide.</div>';\n                return;\n            }\n\n            container.innerHTML = `\n                <table>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>Nom</th>\n                            <th>Type</th>\n                            <th>Taille</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: right;\">Actions</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        ${files.map(file => `\n                            <tr class=\"file-row\">\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    <strong>${file.name}</strong>\n                                </td>\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    <span class=\"badge ${file.type === 'dir' ? 'badge-dir' : 'badge-file'}\">${file.type}</span>\n                                </td>\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    ${file.size ? formatSize(file.size) : '-'}\n                                </td>\n                                <td style=\"text-align: right;\">\n                                    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"justify-content: flex-end;\">\n                                        ${file.type === 'file' ? `<button class=\"secondary\" style=\"padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem;\" onclick=\"openRenameModal('${file.path}', '${file.name}', '${file.sha}')\">Renommer</button>` : ''}\n                                        <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem;\" onclick=\"window.open('${file.html_url}', '_blank')\">Voir sur GitHub</button>\n                                    </div>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                        `).join('')}\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            `;\n        }\n\n        function handleRowClick(type, path, name) {\n            if (type === 'dir') {\n                currentPathStack.push(path);\n                loadPathContents(path);\n            }\n        }\n\n        function filterFiles() {\n            const query = document.getElementById('fileSearch').value.toLowerCase();\n            const filtered = currentFiles.filter(f => f.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n            renderFiles(filtered);\n        }\n\n        function formatSize(bytes) {\n            if (bytes === 0) return '0 Octets';\n            const k = 1024;\n            const sizes = ['Octets', 'Ko', 'Mo', 'Go'];\n            const i = Math.floor(Math.log(bytes) / Math.log(k));\n            return parseFloat((bytes / Math.pow(k, i)).toFixed(2)) + ' ' + sizes[i];\n        }\n\n        function openRenameModal(path, name, sha) {\n            fileToRename = { path, name, sha };\n            document.getElementById('renameFileInfo').innerText = `Chemin actuel : ${path}`;\n            document.getElementById('newFileNameInput').value = name;\n            document.getElementById('renameModal').classList.add('open');\n        }\n\n        function closeRenameModal() {\n            document.getElementById('renameModal').classList.remove('open');\n            fileToRename = null;\n        }\n\n        async function confirmRename() {\n            const newName = document.getElementById('newFileNameInput').value.trim();\n            if (!newName || newName === fileToRename.name) {\n                closeRenameModal();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            const pathParts = fileToRename.path.split('/');\n            pathParts.pop();\n            const newPath = pathParts.length > 0 ? pathParts.join('/') + '/' + newName : newName;\n\n            try {\n                showAlert('Renommage en cours...', 'success');\n                \n                // 1. Récupérer le contenu actuel du fichier\n                const fileData = await githubApi(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${fileToRename.path}`);\n                \n                // 2. Créer le fichier avec le nouveau nom\n                const createRes = await fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${newPath}`, {\n                    method: 'PUT',\n                    headers: {\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                        'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json',\n                        'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n                    },\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Renommer ${fileToRename.name} en ${newName}`,\n                        content: fileData.content\n                    })\n                });\n\n                if (!createRes.ok) throw new Error('Erreur lors de la création du fichier renommé');\n\n                // 3. Supprimer l'ancien fichier\n                const deleteRes = await fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${fileToRename.path}`, {\n                    method: 'DELETE',\n                    headers: {\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer et ${token}`, // Correction syntaxe Auth header en dessous\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                        'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json',\n                        'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n                    },\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Suppression de l'ancien fichier ${fileToRename.name}`,\n                        sha: fileToRename.sha\n                    })\n                });\n\n                if (!deleteRes.ok) throw new Error('Erreur lors de la suppression de l\\'ancien fichier');\n\n                closeRenameModal();\n                showAlert('Fichier renommé avec succès !', 'success');\n                \n                // Recharger le dossier courant\n                const currentFolder = pathParts.join('/');\n                loadPathContents(currentFolder);\n\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du renommage : ' + error.message, 'error');\n                closeRenameModal();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function showAlert(message, type) {\n            const box = document.getElementById('alertBox');\n            box.className = `alert ${type}`;\n            box.innerText = message;\n            box.style.display = 'block';\n        }\n\n        function hideAlert() {\n            document.getElementById('alertBox').style.display = 'none';\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}],"typing":false,"apiHidden":true},{"id":"ciu3h6t79w","role":"user","text":"mobile plus professionnel \nplus stylé plus propre","apiText":"mobile plus professionnel \nplus stylé plus propre","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:23:31.988Z","hidden":false},{"id":"zllwm6t7a2","role":"bot","thinking":false,"text":"Voici la version entièrement repensée de votre application de gestion GitHub. Le design a été modernisé avec une esthétique soignée, des transitions fluides, un mode sombre élégant inspiré des interfaces professionnelles actuelles, et une ergonomie mobile irréprochable (panneaux adaptatifs, navigation tactile optimisée et retours visuels instantanés).","ts":"2026-10-11T13:23:31.994Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Je mets à jour l'application GitHub avec un design ultra-moderne, fluide, responsive et parfaitement optimisé pour mobile et bureau.","status":"done","details":"Je mets à jour l'application GitHub avec un design ultra-moderne, fluide, responsive et parfaitement optimisé pour mobile et bureau."}],"codeBlocks":[{"lang":"html","filename":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\" class=\"h-full\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>GitManager Pro</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            darkMode: 'class',\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        dark: {\n                            50: '#f8fafc',\n                            100: '#f1f5f9',\n                            800: '#1e293b',\n                            900: '#0f172a',\n                            950: '#020617',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-full bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased overflow-hidden\">\n\n    <div id=\"app\" class=\"flex h-full w-full relative\">\n\n        <!-- Vue Configuration Token (Modal / Écran d'accueil) -->\n        <div id=\"auth-screen\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-center space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20 mb-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-github text-3xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white\">GitManager Pro</h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">Gérez vos dépôts et fichiers GitHub en toute fluidité sur mobile et bureau.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <form id=\"auth-form\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2\">Token Personnel GitHub (PAT)</label>\n                        <div class=\"relative\">\n                            <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center pl-3.5 text-slate-500\">\n                                <i class=\"fa-solid fa-key\"></i>\n                            </span>\n                            <input type=\"password\" id=\"token-input\" required placeholder=\"ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" \n                                class=\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500 transition\">\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2\">Nécessite les permissions <code class=\"text-indigo-400 bg-slate-950 px-1 py-0.5 rounded\">repo</code>.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-medium rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/20 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2\">\n                        <span>Se connecter</span>\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Sidebar Dépôts -->\n        <aside id=\"sidebar\" class=\"w-full sm:w-80 bg-slate-900 border-r border-slate-800 flex flex-col h-full absolute sm:relative z-30 transition-transform duration-300 -translate-x-full sm:translate-x-0\">\n            <!-- Header Sidebar -->\n            <div class=\"p-4 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-github text-lg\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h2 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">Vos Dépôts</h2>\n                        <p id=\"user-login\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Chargement...</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <button id=\"logout-btn\" title=\"Changer de token\" class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 transition\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-power-off text-sm\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Recherche Dépôts -->\n            <div class=\"p-3 border-b border-slate-800/60\">\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center pl-3 text-slate-500\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-search text-xs\"></i>\n                    </span>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-repo\" placeholder=\"Filtrer les dépôts...\" \n                        class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-white placeholder-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 transition\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Liste des dépôts -->\n            <div id=\"repos-list\" class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-2 space-y-1\">\n                <!-- Injection dynamique -->\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Contenu Principal (Fichiers) -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col h-full bg-slate-950 relative z-20 w-full\">\n            <!-- Topbar mobile & desktop -->\n            <header class=\"h-16 border-b border-slate-800 px-4 flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 truncate\">\n                    <button id=\"mobile-menu-btn\" class=\"sm:hidden p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 transition\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-bars\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div id=\"current-repo-title\" class=\"truncate\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\">Sélectionnez un dépôt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div id=\"repo-actions\" class=\"hidden items-center space-x-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-40 sm:w-64\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center pl-3 text-slate-500\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-filter text-xs\"></i>\n                        </span>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-file\" placeholder=\"Filtrer les fichiers...\" \n                            class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-xs text-white placeholder-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 transition\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Zone de contenu -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 sm:p-6\">\n                <!-- État vide -->\n                <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-6 space-y-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-folder-open text-2xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-300\">Aucun dépôt sélectionné</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-sm\">Choisissez un dépôt dans la liste latérale pour explorer et renommer ses fichiers.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb & Fil d'ariane -->\n                <div id=\"file-explorer-container\" class=\"hidden space-y-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div id=\"breadcrumb\" class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-slate-400 overflow-x-auto py-1\">\n                        <!-- Fil d'ariane dynamique -->\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tableau des fichiers -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                            <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                                <thead>\n                                    <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Nom</th>\n                                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 hidden sm:table-cell\">Type</th>\n                                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-right\">Actions</th>\n                                    </tr>\n                                </thead>\n                                <tbody id=\"files-list\" class=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/60 text-sm\">\n                                    <!-- Injection fichiers -->\n                                </tbody>\n                            </table>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Modal Renommage -->\n    <div id=\"rename-modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 space-y-6\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white\">Renommer le fichier</h3>\n                <button id=\"close-modal\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <form id=\"rename-form\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2\">Nouveau chemin / nom</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"new-filename-input\" required \n                        class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 transition\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end space-x-3\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel-rename\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium rounded-xl transition\">\n                        Annuler\n                    </button>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submit-rename\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/20 transition flex items-center space-x-2\">\n                        <span>Enregistrer</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Toast Notification -->\n    <div id=\"toast\" class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 max-w-sm\">\n        <div id=\"toast-content\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white px-4 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-2xl flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs\">\n            <i id=\"toast-icon\" class=\"fa-solid text-base\"></i>\n            <span id=\"toast-message\" class=\"font-medium\"></span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let token = localStorage.getItem('gh_token') || '';\n        let currentUser = null;\n        let repos = [];\n        let currentRepo = null;\n        let currentPath = '';\n        let currentFiles = [];\n        let fileToRename = null;\n\n        const authScreen = document.getElementById('auth-screen');\n        const authForm = document.getElementById('auth-form');\n        const tokenInput = document.getElementById('token-input');\n        const userLogin = document.getElementById('user-login');\n        const reposList = document.getElementById('repos-list');\n        const searchRepo = document.getElementById('search-repo');\n        const searchFile = document.getElementById('search-file');\n        const emptyState = document.getElementById('empty-state');\n        const fileExplorerContainer = document.getElementById('file-explorer-container');\n        const currentRepoTitle = document.getElementById('current-repo-title');\n        const repoActions = document.getElementById('repo-actions');\n        const filesList = document.getElementById('files-list');\n        const breadcrumb = document.getElementById('breadcrumb');\n        const sidebar = document.getElementById('sidebar');\n        const mobileMenuBtn = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-btn');\n        const logoutBtn = document.getElementById('logout-btn');\n\n        const renameModal = document.getElementById('rename-modal');\n        const renameForm = document.getElementById('rename-form');\n        const newFilenameInput = document.getElementById('new-filename-input');\n        const closeModal = document.getElementById('close-modal');\n        const cancelRename = document.getElementById('cancel-rename');\n\n        function showToast(message, type = 'success') {\n            const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\n            const icon = document.getElementById('toast-icon');\n            const msg = document.getElementById('toast-message');\n            \n            msg.textContent = message;\n            icon.className = type === 'success' ? 'fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-400 text-base' : 'fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation text-rose-400 text-base';\n            \n            toast.classList.remove('translate-y-20', 'opacity-0');\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                toast.classList.add('translate-y-20', 'opacity-0');\n            }, 3500);\n        }\n\n        async function api(endpoint, options = {}) {\n            const res = await fetch(`https://api.github.com${endpoint}`, {\n                ...options,\n                headers: {\n                    'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                    'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json',\n                    'X-GitHub-Api-Version': '2022-11-28',\n                    ...options.headers\n                }\n            });\n            if (!res.ok) {\n                const err = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n                throw new Error(err.message || `Erreur API GitHub (${res.status})`);\n            }\n            if (res.status === 204) return null;\n            return res.json();\n        }\n\n        async function initApp() {\n            if (!token) {\n                authScreen.classList.remove('hidden');\n                authScreen.classList.add('flex');\n                return;\n            }\n            authScreen.classList.remove('flex');\n            authScreen.classList.add('hidden');\n\n            try {\n                currentUser = await api('/user');\n                userLogin.textContent = `@${currentUser.login}`;\n                await loadRepos();\n            } catch (e) {\n                showToast(e.message, 'error');\n                logout();\n            }\n        }\n\n        async function loadRepos() {\n            try {\n                repos = await api('/user/repos?per_page=100&sort=updated');\n                renderRepos(repos);\n            } catch (e) {\n                showToast('Impossible de charger les dépôts', 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderRepos(list) {\n            reposList.innerHTML = '';\n            if (list.length === 0) {\n                reposList.innerHTML = '<div class=\"p-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500\">Aucun dépôt trouvé</div>';\n                return;\n            }\n            list.forEach(repo => {\n                const item = document.createElement('div');\n                item.className = `p-3 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition flex items-center space-x-3 ${currentRepo && currentRepo.full_name === repo.full_name ? 'bg-indigo-600/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-white' : 'hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300'}`;\n                item.innerHTML = `\n                    <div class=\"text-slate-500\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-book-bookmark\"></i></div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 truncate\">\n                        <div class=\"font-medium text-xs truncate\">${repo.name}</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 truncate\">${repo.private ? 'Privé' : 'Public'} • ${repo.default_branch}</div>\n                    </div>\n                `;\n                item.onclick = () => {\n                    selectRepo(repo);\n                    if (window.innerWidth < 640) {\n                        sidebar.classList.add('-translate-x-full');\n                    }\n                };\n                reposList.appendChild(item);\n            });\n        }\n\n        async function selectRepo(repo, path = '') {\n            currentRepo = repo;\n            currentPath = path;\n            currentRepoTitle.innerHTML = `\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs truncate\">\n                    <span class=\"text-slate-400\">${repo.name}</span>\n                    ${path ? `<span class=\"text-slate-600\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">${path}</span>` : ''}\n                </div>\n            `;\n            repoActions.classList.remove('hidden');\n            repoActions.classList.add('flex');\n            emptyState.classList.add('hidden');\n            fileExplorerContainer.classList.remove('hidden');\n\n            renderRepos(repos.filter(r => r.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchRepo.value.toLowerCase())));\n\n            try {\n                currentFiles = await api(`/repos/${repo.full_name}/contents/${path}`);\n                if (!Array.isArray(currentFiles)) currentFiles = [currentFiles];\n                renderFiles(currentFiles);\n                renderBreadcrumb();\n            } catch (e) {\n                showToast(e.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderFiles(files) {\n            filesList.innerHTML = '';\n            if (files.length === 0) {\n                filesList.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"p-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500\">Ce dossier est vide</td></tr>`;\n                return;\n            }\n\n            files.forEach(file => {\n                const tr = document.createElement('tr');\n                tr.className = 'hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition group';\n                const isDir = file.type === 'dir';\n                \n                tr.innerHTML = `\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"${isDir ? `selectRepo(currentRepo, '${file.path}')` : ''}\">\n                            <span class=\"${isDir ? 'text-amber-400' : 'text-slate-400'}\">\n                                <i class=\"fa-solid ${isDir ? 'fa-folder' : 'fa-file-code'}\"></i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-slate-200 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition\">${file.name}</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 hidden sm:table-cell text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase\">${file.type}</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-right\">\n                        <button onclick=\"openRenameModal('${file.path}', '${file.name}')\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen-to-square mr-1.5\"></i> Renommer\n                        </button>\n                    </td>\n                `;\n                filesList.appendChild(tr);\n            });\n        }\n\n        function renderBreadcrumb() {\n            breadcrumb.innerHTML = '';\n            const parts = currentPath ? currentPath.split('/') : [];\n            \n            let html = `<span class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-white\" onclick=\"selectRepo(currentRepo, '')\">${currentRepo.name}</span>`;\n            let accumulated = '';\n            \n            parts.forEach((part, idx) => {\n                accumulated += (idx === 0 ? '' : '/') + part;\n                html += `<span class=\"text-slate-600\">/</span><span class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-white\" onclick=\"selectRepo(currentRepo, '${accumulated}')\">${part}</span>`;\n            });\n            breadcrumb.innerHTML = html;\n        }\n\n        function openRenameModal(path, name) {\n            fileToRename = { path, name };\n            newFilenameInput.value = path;\n            renameModal.classList.remove('hidden');\n            renameModal.classList.add('flex');\n            newFilenameInput.focus();\n        }\n\n        function closeRenameModal() {\n            renameModal.classList.remove('flex');\n            renameModal.classList.add('hidden');\n            fileToRename = null;\n        }\n\n        async function renameFile(oldPath, newPath) {\n            if (oldPath === newPath) return;\n            try {\n                // 1. Récupérer le contenu du fichier\n                const fileData = await api(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${oldPath}`);\n                \n                // 2. Créer le nouveau fichier avec le même contenu\n                await api(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${newPath}`, {\n                    method: 'PUT',\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Renommer ${oldPath} en ${newPath}`,\n                        content: fileData.content,\n                        sha: undefined\n                    })\n                });\n\n                // 3. Supprimer l'ancien fichier\n                await api(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${oldPath}`, {\n                    method: 'DELETE',\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Suppression ancien fichier suite au renommage`,\n                        sha: fileData.sha\n                    })\n                });\n\n                showToast('Fichier renommé avec succès !');\n                closeRenameModal();\n                selectRepo(currentRepo, currentPath);\n            } catch (e) {\n                showToast(e.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function logout() {\n            localStorage.removeItem('gh_token');\n            token = '';\n            initApp();\n        }\n\n        // Événements\n        authForm.onsubmit = (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            token = tokenInput.value.trim();\n            localStorage.setItem('gh_token', token);\n            initApp();\n        };\n\n        logoutBtn.onclick = logout;\n\n        searchRepo.oninput = (e) => {\n            const q = e.target.value.toLowerCase();\n            renderRepos(repos.filter(r => r.name.toLowerCase().includes(q)));\n        };\n\n        searchFile.oninput = (e) => {\n            const q = e.target.value.toLowerCase();\n            const filtered = currentFiles.filter(f => f.name.toLowerCase().includes(q));\n            renderFiles(filtered);\n        };\n\n        mobileMenuBtn.onclick = () => {\n            sidebar.classList.toggle('-translate-x-full');\n        };\n\n        closeModal.onclick = closeRenameModal;\n        cancelRename.onclick = closeRenameModal;\n\n        renameForm.onsubmit = (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            if (!fileToRename) return;\n            const newPath = newFilenameInput.value.trim();\n            renameFile(fileToRename.path, newPath);\n        };\n\n        // Lancement\n        initApp();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}],"typing":false,"apiHidden":true},{"id":"l4n03byq3e","role":"user","text":"ça n'a pas renommée","apiText":"ça n'a pas renommée\n\n[Scan QR de l'image \"Screenshot_20261011-152719.jpg\"] : aucun QR code lisible détecté automatiquement dans cette image (l'analyse s'est faite entièrement côté application, avant même que ce message ne t'atteigne — tu n'as aucun autre outil ou terminal capable d'y accéder ou de retenter). Si l'image contient malgré tout un visuel qui ressemble à un QR code, décris-le honnêtement comme une observation visuelle, sans jamais prétendre avoir extrait ou déchiffré des données qui n'ont pas été trouvées.","attachments":[{"id":"87szhwyjdn","name":"Screenshot_20261011-152719.jpg","type":"image/jpeg","size":143985,"githubUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nps-nelson/nps-memory/main/uploads/87szhwyjdn-Screenshot_20261011-152719.jpg"}],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:27:49.658Z","hidden":false},{"id":"6en6hpyq48","role":"bot","thinking":true,"text":"","ts":"2026-10-11T13:27:49.688Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Réflexion en cours…","status":"loading"}]}]}